scenario: DISP-BRIGHT-01
title: Brightness keys and slider
area: Display
rows: F-DISP-01, F-KBD-03
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A laptop or a screen with brightness control.
step: Press the brightness up key three times, then down three times.
expect: The screen gets brighter then dimmer in steps, with an indicator.
clause: F-KBD-03.keys
step: Move the brightness slider in Settings, Display.
expect: The screen follows the slider and the keys show the same level.
clause: F-DISP-01.slider
step: Set the lowest level.
expect: The screen is dim but you can still read it; it does not go fully black.
clause: F-KBD-03.floor
